@startuml Manager View Statistics Sequence
title Sequence Diagram: Xem báo cáo thống kê (Manager)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "admin-dashboard.html" as UI
control "StatisticsController" as Ctrl
entity "StatisticsService" as Svc
database "MySQL" as DB

Manager -> UI: Chọn khoảng thời gian (Start Date, End Date)
UI -> Ctrl: GET /api/statistics/overview?start=...&end=...
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: getOverview(startDate, endDate)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: calculateTotalRevenue(start, end)
Svc -> DB: countTotalTickets(start, end)
Svc -> DB: findTopMovies(start, end)

Svc --> Ctrl: StatisticsResponse
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK (JSON Statistics)
deactivate Ctrl

UI -> Manager: Hiển thị biểu đồ & Báo cáo số liệu
@enduml
